{% extends '_layout.txt.twig' %}

{% block content %}
REMINDER — unpaid invoice
================================

Hello,

this is a friendly reminder that invoice no. {{ invoice.varsymbol }}
is {{ days_overdue }} day{% if days_overdue != 1 %}s{% endif %} overdue and has not been paid yet.

Variable symbol: {{ invoice.varsymbol }}
Issue date:      {{ invoice.issue_date|date('M j, Y') }}
Due date:        {{ invoice.due_date|date('M j, Y') }}
Days overdue:    {{ days_overdue }}
Amount due:      {{ amount_to_pay|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} {{ invoice.currency }}{% if late_interest %}


Late-payment interest as of {{ late_interest.as_of|date('M j, Y') }}: {{ late_interest.interest|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} {{ invoice.currency }}
{% if late_interest.fixed_cost.claimable %}Fixed compensation of the costs of claiming the receivable: CZK {{ late_interest.fixed_cost.amount_czk|number_format(2, '.', ',') }}
{% endif %}We claim late-payment interest from {{ late_interest.delay_from|date('M j, Y') }}: annual rate {{ late_interest.annual_rate_percent|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} % = CNB two-week repo rate {{ late_interest.repo.rate_percent|number_format(2, '.', ',') }} % valid on {{ late_interest.repo.half_year_start|date('M j, Y') }} + 8 percentage points (section 1970 of the Czech Civil Code, section 2 of Government Regulation No. 351/2013 Sb.).{% endif %}


The invoice PDF is attached.
If payment was sent in the past few days, please disregard this reminder.

Thank you.
{% endblock %}
